#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open a batch {#open-a-batch}"
msgstr "Buka batch {#open-a-batch}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can open a runtime batch by using the context manager `with Batch(...)` or by initializing the `Batch`\n"
"class. When you start a batch,  you must specify a QPU by passing a `backend` object.  The batch starts when its first job begins execution.\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa membuka runtime batch menggunakan context manager `with Batch(...)` atau dengan menginisialisasi class `Batch`. Saat memulai batch, Anda harus menentukan QPU dengan meneruskan objek `backend`. Batch dimulai ketika job pertamanya mulai dieksekusi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Batch class**\n"
msgstr "**Class Batch**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Context manager**\n"
msgstr "**Context manager**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The context manager automatically opens and closes the batch.\n"
msgstr "Context manager secara otomatis membuka dan menutup batch.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"specify-batch-length\"></span>\n"
